  "title": "India-China Ties Reaching New Heights as Border Peace and Economic Cooperation Enhance Bilateral Relations",
  "summary": "India and China are strengthening their strategic ties, particularly in defense and security areas, while India's growing involvement in the Brics has expanded. The relations are evolving amid ongoing geopolitical tensions.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "India and Japan are strengthening their strategic ties, particularly in defense and security areas, while India's growing involvement in the Brics has expanded.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "India's External Affairs Minister S Jaishankar emphasized that India-China relations are improving, with border peace and economic cooperation being key factors.",
